<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5478"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 8:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The police never questioned him?  That is unbelievable!  I think Tom should give Charlie a &#34;special&#34; username and password and start a thread called Q &amp; A with Charlie.  I would love to know what he knows.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5478-->
<!--Post: 5479--><!--Time: 1107144495-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5479"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jim44095<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jim44095<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 8:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I agree Dee even if they saw him as a child he was 15 yrs old for crying out loud! <BR>He may know something and just doesn&#39;t even know it! <BR> <BR>Give him a q&amp;a thread,that is a very good idea!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
