<!--Post: 5490--><!--Time: 1107147396-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5490"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 8:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->What a great article!  Thanks, Jim.  Charlie had some great things to say, all the way around.  Wow.  And a lot of interesting clues, too.  You&#39;re right - the suspect pool is getting deeper and richer.  With all the Coleman shenanigans going on at the time, the lines you note take on added significance.  She may very well have helped the wrong person - or given him an answer he didn&#39;t want to hear.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
